{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>His buckets.</b> From his wells, and its interpretation is as the Targum renders." "<b>And his seed by abundant waters.</b> This is an expression of success — like seed sown upon the face of the waters." "<b>And higher than Agag shall be his king.</b> Their first king will conquer Agag king of Amalek." "<b>And his kingdom shall be exalted.</b> That of Jacob, more and more — for David and Solomon will come after him."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:32.255118259Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}